{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690/events","html_url":"https://github.com/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690","id":1625582104,"node_id":"I_kwDOCA8Bec5g5GoY","number":4690,"title":"classmethod_descriptor","user":{"login":"seungha-kim","id":767106,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzEwNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/767106?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim","html_url":"https://github.com/seungha-kim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seungha-kim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-03-15T13:56:59Z","updated_at":"2023-03-15T14:52:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Feature\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# In CPython\r\n>>> type(dict.__dict__[\"fromkeys\"])\r\n<class 'classmethod_descriptor'>\r\n>>> type(dict.fromkeys)\r\n<class 'builtin_function_or_method'>\r\n\r\n# In RustPython\r\n>>>>> type(dict.__dict__[\"fromkeys\"])\r\n<class 'classmethod'>\r\n>>>>> type(dict.fromkeys)\r\n<class 'builtin_function_or_method'>\r\n```\r\n\r\n- `<class 'classmethod'>` is for descriptors of Python-side `@classmethod`.\r\n  - `PyClassMethod_Type` in CPython\r\n  - `PyClassMethod` in RustPython\r\n- `<class 'classmethod_descriptor'>` is for descriptors of **native-side** class method.\r\n  - `PyClassMethodDescr_Type` in CPython\r\n  - Nothing in RustPython, instead using `PyClassMethod`\r\n\r\n(Yeah, these names are somewhat confusing...)\r\n\r\nIn short, RustPython uses a different type from CPython for built-in class methods.\r\n\r\nI don't know if it causes any real difference in behavior. There is no test for this in CPython (only [a mysterious comment](https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/0c857865e4f255f99d58678f878e09c11da89892/Lib/test/test_sys.py#L1383) exists)\r\n\r\n## Python Documentation\r\n\r\nNo documents were found.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/4690/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}